1
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:06,400
(Bernadette:)All right. Here you go.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,900
(Bernadette:)Two lemonades,

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,700
(Bernadette:)one iced tea

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,070
(Bernadette:)and a root beer for Priya.

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:16,210
- Is it diet?
- That's what you ordered.

6
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,040
(Priya:)Thank you.

7
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,110
(Priya:)Hey, have you and Howard

8
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:21,510
(Priya:)started planning
your wedding yet?

9
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,780
(Bernadette:)Yeah. We're thinking
of having it on a cliff

10
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,180
(Bernadette:)overlooking the ocean.

11
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,750
(Howard:)Nothing soothes
those pre-wedding jitters

12
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:31,080
(Howard:)like the thought
of falling and drowning.

13
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,590
(Leonard:)What did your mother say

14
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,990
(Leonard:)when you told her you were
getting married?

15
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:35,360
(Bernadette:)He hasn't told her yet.

16
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,660
(Bernadette:)He's waiting for
the right time.

17
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:40,430
(Howard:)I was thinking of weaving
it into her eulogy.

18
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:43,430
(Priya:)Howard, you've got
to tell your mother.

19
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,630
(Howard:)Hey, have you told your parents
you're dating

20
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:46,630
(Howard:)this short glass
of skim milk here?

21
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:50,630
(Priya:)Uh... that's different.

22
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,670
(Priya:)First of all,
we're not engaged;

23
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:54,440
(Priya:)and second,
Indian parents

24
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,200
(Priya:)are very protective
of their children.

25
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,240
(Howard:)Right, right,
whereas Jewish mothers

26
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:04,020
(Howard:)take a casual, la-di-da
approach to their sons.

